cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LEAF, please cite it as below."
title: "LEAF: Latency-Budgeted Efficient Planning with Attention Forecasts for Training-Free Token Reduction"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
abstract: >-
  Training-free token reduction for frozen Vision Transformers. LEAF plans, for a given backbone, device and latency
  budget, where to reduce, how many tokens to keep, how to remove them (prune or merge) and how much the token score
  trusts a forecast of future attention, by a Lagrangian dynamic program over single-station probes and a
  station-aware latency estimate.
keywords:
  - vision transformer
  - token reduction
  - token merging
  - efficient inference
  - latency
